      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARA'S BRIENNE (7) was well fancied as favourite latest and led for much of the way but faded to place, beaten 0.8 lengths (19.75) at this track in a Maiden over 352m. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Top prospect. BANKSY'S BEST (1) scored (22.53) last time out over 390m at this track 11 weeks ago. Goes very well at the trip finding the frame in each of three starts. Overall strike-rate good and can feature with the right run. BLUE FAIRY (2) comes off an average effort last start when eighth at this track over 352m behind Goldstar Hunter (20.74) in a Grade 6. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Must be included in calculations. MOROBE MISCHIEF (8) placed last start at this track and distance and is in the mix again.",
